  "m_dialogList": {
    "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.ActorDialogList, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
    "m_dialogs": [
      {
        "m_dialogTag": "Prep",
        "m_dialogEntries": [
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AH-WHITE-NPC01-B_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "I mean... I guess we did see those corrupting ghosty monster things.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Moose_Professor_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Tarrak_Hadfield_AH-WHITE_152.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1752268,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AH-WHITE-NPC01-B_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Ooh, is that what drove the Shellions mad?",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Jackalope_Professor_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Jaki_Whisperwind_AH-WHITE_104.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1752362,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AH-WHITE-NPC01-B_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Maybe? There were Shellions? Good sign, I guess. But these things were also impacting the Eldritch in here... distorting them somehow.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Moose_Professor_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Tarrak_Hadfield_AH-WHITE_153.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1752268,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AH-WHITE-NPC01-B_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Weird they're not affecting us. Maybe they only affect aquatic creatures? Or just get to them first? Either way... the gallery was sacked. So now what?",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Jackalope_Professor_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Jaki_Whisperwind_AH-WHITE_105.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1752362,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AH-WHITE-NPC01-B_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Best guess is as everything was crumbling, the Eldritch grabbed up what they could and ran. Which means, these feuding factions might have what we need.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Moose_Professor_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Tarrak_Hadfield_AH-WHITE_154.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1752268,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AH-WHITE-NPC01-B_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Then we just need a way to make someone from all three groups see reason. I bet if we just approach them, with hearts open, they will listen.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Jackalope_Professor_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Jaki_Whisperwind_AH-WHITE_106.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1752362,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
